    {
      "id": "dbcbe19e-cbe0-4b1e-bb5f-1c881ec7333c",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1ba35e12",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Edvora SMS callbacks — inactive until integration\nThe backend /api/webhooks/termii requires the dedicated TERMII_WEBHOOK_SECRET using ?token= or x-termii-token. It rejects unsigned reports and missing provider message IDs. No API-key fallback. Raw reports persist before processing.\n/api/automation/sms-delivery/claim returns authenticated, leased inbox records. /apply verifies event/claim ownership and uses the persisted provider ID and status; a caller cannot replace event data. Updates and inbox acknowledgement are atomic.\nEarly unmatched callbacks stay pending with 5-minute backoff, up to five matches before quarantine; ambiguous matches and unknown statuses are quarantined. Delivered is never downgraded by delayed sent/failed reports. No outgoing messages originate here, and Telegram read receipts are never invented.\nConfigure the backend URL/service credential and verify actual Termii callback fields before publishing.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
  ],
